# Boss_Hatter_RoadHazardHit when Hitbox_CanHitTarget refuses the hit (ruling 5, 2), at its first
# call (fuzz-113400-s2, the one corpus hit): the rts at $03DE6C. blinking: the struck player is
# still invulnerable from an earlier hit (its sprite block's +$16 nonzero), as a player is for a
# while after any hit, when a hazard reaches it; struck: the player box was already struck this
# frame (+$3C bit 0, set by the first accepted hit: two hazards side by side on the road).

case blinking
b {{a2 + $2E} + $C} + $16 = $20

case struck
b a2 + $3C = 1
